# Next.js / React

Also `.agent/rules/next-react-rules.md`.

- Pages under `app/`; RSC default; `'use client'` only for hooks/motion/events/browser APIs.
- Internal: `next/link`. External/`mailto:`/`tel:`: `<a>`. Raster: `next/image` + `alt` (decorative: `alt=""` + `aria-hidden`). SVG: `<img>` OK.
- Icons: `lucide-react` or existing brand SVGs. Tailwind 4 + `globals.css` tokens — no hardcoded hex when a token exists.
- After UI/logic: `npm run lint`. Route/action/config: also `npm run build`.
